msgstr "(optional)"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1109
msgid "One IP address or CIDR range per line."
msgstr "Eine IP-Adresse oder ein CIDR-Bereich pro Zeile."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1110
msgid "Leave empty to allow any IP."
msgstr "Leer lassen, um jede IP zuzulassen."

#. translators: %s: the HTTP error returned, formatted as code.
#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1114
#, php-format
msgid "When set, only these addresses may use the API; others get %s."
msgstr ""
"Wenn gesetzt, dürfen nur diese Adressen die API nutzen; andere erhalten %s."

#. translators: %s: the visitor's current IP address, formatted as code.
#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1121
#, php-format
msgid "Your current IP: %s"
msgstr "Deine aktuelle IP: %s"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1130
msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr "Fähigkeiten"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1132
msgid "Enable all"
msgstr "Alle aktivieren"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1133
msgid "Disable all"
msgstr "Alle deaktivieren"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1151
msgid "Allow code execution"
msgstr "Codeausführung erlauben"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1153
msgid ""
"Lets the API run arbitrary PHP — the universal fallback for configuring any "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Erlaubt der API, beliebiges PHP auszuführen — der universelle Rückfallweg "
"zur Konfiguration jedes Plugins."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1154
msgid "Off by default."
msgstr "Standardmäßig aus."

#. translators: %s: the capability name, formatted as code.
#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1158
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Only enable it if you trust the API key holder completely; it is as powerful "
"as installing a plugin. Requires the %s capability above."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviere es nur, wenn du dem Inhaber des API-Schlüssels vollständig "
"vertraust; es ist so mächtig wie ein Plugin zu installieren. Erfordert die "
"Fähigkeit %s oben."

#. translators: %s: a list of always-available endpoints, formatted as code.
#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Discovery routes (%s) are always available so an agent can inspect the site."
msgstr ""
"Discovery-Routen (%s) sind immer verfügbar, damit ein Agent die Website "
"prüfen kann."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1179
msgid "Save permissions"
msgstr "Berechtigungen speichern"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1201
msgid "Documentation file not found."
msgstr "Dokumentationsdatei nicht gefunden."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1205
msgid "API & Agent Skill"
msgstr "API & Agenten-Skill"

#. translators: %s: the endpoint URL, formatted as code.
#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1211
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hand this to any AI agent so it can build your site through the plugin's "
"REST API. It is also served at %s."
msgstr ""
"Gib dies einem beliebigen KI-Agenten, damit er deine Website über die REST-"
"API des Plugins bauen kann. Es wird auch unter %s ausgeliefert."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1215
msgid ""
"The Skill is English on every locale: it is read by a language model, and "
"translating it would make the model worse at the job."
msgstr ""
"Der Skill bleibt in jeder Sprache englisch: Ihn liest ein Sprachmodell, und "
"eine Übersetzung würde das Modell schlechter machen."

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1218
msgid "Copy all"
msgstr "Alles kopieren"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1219
msgid "Open raw Skill"
msgstr "Rohen Skill öffnen"

#: includes/class-pp-admin.php:1220
msgid "OpenAPI spec (JSON)"
msgstr "OpenAPI-Spezifikation (JSON)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:54
msgid "Pages & posts (create / edit / delete content)"
msgstr "Seiten & Beiträge (Inhalte anlegen / bearbeiten / löschen)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:55
msgid "Media library (upload & list images)"
msgstr "Mediathek (Bilder hochladen & auflisten)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:56
msgid "Navigation menus (create & edit menus)"
msgstr "Navigationsmenüs (Menüs anlegen & bearbeiten)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:57
msgid "Templates (Elementor Theme Builder, block themes, patterns)"
msgstr "Templates (Elementor Theme Builder, Block-Themes, Muster)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:58
msgid "Global styles & CSS (Additional CSS, theme.json global styles)"
msgstr "Globale Styles & CSS (Zusätzliches CSS, theme.json-Styles)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:59
msgid "Themes (install, activate, switch)"
msgstr "Themes (installieren, aktivieren, wechseln)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:60
msgid "Plugins (install, activate, deactivate, delete)"
msgstr "Plugins (installieren, aktivieren, deaktivieren, löschen)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:61
msgid "Site settings (options, homepage, permalinks)"
msgstr "Website-Einstellungen (Optionen, Startseite, Permalinks)"

#: includes/class-pp-auth.php:62
msgid ""
"Plugin & site configuration (read/write any option, meta & terms; snapshots/"
"restore; discovery; REST proxy; plugin adapters)"
msgstr ""
"Plugin- & Website-Konfiguration (beliebige Optionen, Meta & Terme lesen/"
"schreiben; Snapshots/Wiederherstellung; Discovery; REST-Proxy; Plugin-"
"Adapter)"

#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:673
msgid "Claude Pro / Max subscription"
msgstr "Claude-Pro/Max-Abo"


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:676
msgid ""
"Run this once in your terminal. The Claude Code extensions for VS Code and "
"JetBrains share the same configuration, so they pick it up too. Add --scope "
"user to make it available in every project."
msgstr "Führe dies einmal im Terminal aus. Die Claude-Code-Erweiterungen für VS Code und JetBrains teilen dieselbe Konfiguration und übernehmen sie ebenfalls. Mit --scope user ist es in jedem Projekt verfügbar."


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:695
msgid "Claude Free (one connector), Pro, Max, Team or Enterprise"
msgstr "Claude Free (ein Connector), Pro, Max, Team oder Enterprise"


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:698
msgid ""
"In the Claude app or claude.ai: Customize → Connectors → \"+\" → Add custom "
"connector, and paste this URL. The app cannot send a custom header, so the "
"key rides in the URL — turn on \"Key in the URL\" in Settings below first. "
"Your site must be reachable from the public internet."
msgstr "In der Claude-App oder auf claude.ai: Customize → Connectors → „+“ → Add custom connector, und diese URL einfügen. Die App kann keinen eigenen Header senden, also fährt der Schlüssel in der URL mit — schalte zuerst unten in den Einstellungen „Schlüssel in der URL“ ein. Deine Website muss aus dem öffentlichen Internet erreichbar sein."


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:703 includes/class-pp-mcp.php:711
msgid "ChatGPT Plus / Pro / Team subscription"
msgstr "ChatGPT-Plus/Pro/Team-Abo"


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:706
msgid ""
"Add this to ~/.codex/config.toml. The Codex CLI and the Codex IDE extension "
"read the same file. Export PRESSPILOT_KEY in your shell so the token stays "
"out of the file."
msgstr "Füge dies in ~/.codex/config.toml ein. Die Codex-CLI und die Codex-IDE-Erweiterung lesen dieselbe Datei. Exportiere PRESSPILOT_KEY in deiner Shell, damit das Token nicht in der Datei landet."


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:714
msgid ""
"In ChatGPT: Settings → Security and login → turn on Developer mode, then add "
"a connector with this URL. ChatGPT cannot send a custom header, so the key "
"rides in the URL — turn on \"Key in the URL\" in Settings below first."
msgstr "In ChatGPT: Settings → Security and login → Developer mode einschalten, dann einen Connector mit dieser URL hinzufügen. ChatGPT kann keinen eigenen Header senden, also fährt der Schlüssel in der URL mit — schalte zuerst unten in den Einstellungen „Schlüssel in der URL“ ein."


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:719
msgid "GitHub Copilot subscription"
msgstr "GitHub-Copilot-Abo"


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:722
msgid ""
"Save as .vscode/mcp.json in your workspace (or add to your user profile). VS "
"Code asks for the key once, the first time the server starts, and stores it "
"securely. The tools then show up in Copilot Chat agent mode."
msgstr "Als .vscode/mcp.json im Workspace speichern (oder dem Benutzerprofil hinzufügen). VS Code fragt den Schlüssel einmal ab, beim ersten Start des Servers, und speichert ihn sicher. Die Werkzeuge erscheinen dann im Agent-Modus des Copilot-Chats."


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:746
msgid "The editor's own subscription"
msgstr "Das Abo des Editors selbst"


#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:749
msgid ""
"Add to .cursor/mcp.json in your project, or to the editor's global MCP "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Füge dies in .cursor/mcp.json in deinem Projekt ein oder in die globalen MCP-"
"Einstellungen des Editors."

#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:763
msgid "Any client (URL only)"
msgstr "Beliebiger Client (nur URL)"

#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:768
msgid ""
"For clients that accept only a URL and no custom headers. The key travels in "
"the URL, so it can end up in server and proxy logs — prefer a header where "
"you can."
msgstr ""
"Für Clients, die nur eine URL und keine eigenen Header akzeptieren. Der "
"Schlüssel wandert in der URL und kann in Server- und Proxy-Logs landen — "
"bevorzuge nach Möglichkeit einen Header."

#: includes/class-pp-mcp.php:769
msgid ""
"Turn on \"Key in the URL\" below to use this form. It suits clients that "
"accept only a URL and no custom headers."
msgstr ""
"Schalte unten „Schlüssel in der URL“ ein, um diese Form zu nutzen. Sie passt "
"zu Clients, die nur eine URL und keine eigenen Header akzeptieren."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:60
msgid ""
"Claude directly from Anthropic. Best tool-use reliability for long site "
"builds."
msgstr ""
"Claude direkt von Anthropic. Die zuverlässigste Werkzeugnutzung für lange "
"Website-Builds."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:68
msgid "The same key your Codex CLI uses."
msgstr "Derselbe Schlüssel, den deine Codex-CLI nutzt."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:76
msgid ""
"One key, hundreds of models from every vendor. Model ids look like "
"\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5\"."
msgstr ""
"Ein Schlüssel, Hunderte Modelle aller Anbieter. Modell-IDs sehen aus wie "
"„anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5“."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:90
msgid "OpenAI-compatible gateway across many vendors."
msgstr "OpenAI-kompatibles Gateway über viele Anbieter."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:98
msgid ""
"Open models (MiniMax, Kimi, DeepSeek) on a decentralised GPU network, at a "
"fraction of the usual price. Model ids are namespaced, e.g. \"MiniMaxAI/"
"MiniMax-M2.7\"."
msgstr ""
"Offene Modelle (MiniMax, Kimi, DeepSeek) in einem dezentralen GPU-Netz, zu "
"einem Bruchteil des üblichen Preises. Modell-IDs sind mit Namensraum "
"versehen, z. B. „MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7“."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:101
msgid "Custom (OpenAI-compatible)"
msgstr "Benutzerdefiniert (OpenAI-kompatibel)"

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:106
msgid ""
"Any endpoint that speaks /chat/completions — a local Ollama or vLLM server, "
"LiteLLM, a company gateway."
msgstr ""
"Jeder Endpunkt, der /chat/completions spricht — ein lokaler Ollama- oder "
"vLLM-Server, LiteLLM, ein Firmen-Gateway."

#: includes/class-pp-providers.php:611
msgid ""
"The provider rejected the API key. It is usually expired, revoked, or out of "
"credit; issue a fresh one in the provider's console and paste it above."
msgstr ""
"Der Anbieter hat den API-Schlüssel abgelehnt. Meist ist er abgelaufen, "
"widerrufen oder das Guthaben ist aufgebraucht; erstelle in der Konsole des "
"Anbieters einen neuen und füge ihn oben ein."

